{
  "$comment": [
    "What each campus location is called on Ramapo's map, where the two differ.",
    "",
    "Ramapo rebuilt the map on Concept3D and the names moved with it. Resolution",
    "is exact-name-or-alias and nothing else: an entry here is a mapping someone",
    "checked, not a guess a matcher made. A location with no exact name and no",
    "alias resolves to nothing and opens the plain campus map, which is what it",
    "did before any of this and is never wrong.",
    "",
    "`locations` maps our name to theirs. `categories` maps our name to a whole",
    "category, for entries that describe a kind of place rather than one place.",
    "Deliberately absent: Competition Soccer Field, Running Track and Stadium",
    "Field, and Visitor's Circle. The new map has no track at all, and the field",
    "names it does carry are different places, not different spellings."
  ],

